<view class="page-container page-container--padded"><top-bar title="支持资源" back="true"></top-bar><view class="page-shell__description">如果你需要，可以联系可信任的人、校内支持或当地紧急服务。资源来自当前环境配置。</view><view wx:if="{{context === 'safety'}}" class="safety-panel"><text>先照顾当下的安全，不需要独自处理。</text></view><state-message wx:if="{{error}}" title="资源暂时不可用" message="{{error}}" action-label="重新加载" bindaction="load"></state-message><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="surface"><text class="muted">正在加载支持资源…</text></view><view wx:elif="{{!resources.length}}" class="surface"><text class="muted">当前环境尚未配置支持资源。你可以先联系一位信任的人，必要时联系当地紧急服务。</text></view><view wx:else><view wx:for="{{resources}}" wx:key="id" class="surface resource"><view class="section-title" style="margin-top:0">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.description}}</view><view class="muted">更新时间：{{item.updatedAt}}</view><button wx:if="{{item.phone}}" class="resource-action" data-phone="{{item.phone}}" bindtap="call">拨打 {{item.phone}}</button></view></view><primary-button wx:if="{{context === 'safety' && safetyState !== 'cannot_be_safe'}}" label="返回继续观察" secondary="true" bindaction="backToAnswer"></primary-button></view>
